{"about_the_game":"&quot;Velgrym&quot; is a challenging 3D climbing action game featuring a unique system in which you move by throwing skulls.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlayers take on the role of a skeletal protagonist,<br />\r\nclimbing a tower on the verge of collapse.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0 Features<br />\r\n- Throw a skull and teleport to that location.<br />\r\n- Regenerate your body in mid-air and throw up to two times in a row.<br />\r\n- Landing on the ground restores your throw count.<br />\r\n- Unstable footing and challenging controls.<br />\r\n- Falling starts you back to the beginning.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA dark and serious worldview.<br />\r\nEverything depends on the player's judgment and precision.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA single wrong step can cost you tens of minutes.<br />\r\nBut only those determined to climb will reach the top.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3975340?t=1774666841","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3975340?t=1774666841","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975340/f91f45e4379e241b1338ba71a44c5819324f211e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774666841","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975340/f91f45e4379e241b1338ba71a44c5819324f211e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774666841","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"&quot;Velgrym&quot; is a challenging 3D climbing action game featuring a unique system in which you move by throwing skulls.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlayers take on the role of a skeletal protagonist,<br />\r\nclimbing a tower on the verge of collapse.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0